1
00:00:00,025 --> 00:00:02,115
(Sheldon:)Leonard, come back.
Leonard, come back.

2
00:00:02,327 --> 00:00:03,417
(Sheldon:)Leonard, come back.

3
00:00:03,662 --> 00:00:04,992
- What?
- Oh, of course.

4
00:00:05,197 --> 00:00:07,167
(Sheldon:)It only works on the weak-minded.

5
00:00:16,575 --> 00:00:19,845
(Leonard:)Good morning, sunshine.

6
00:00:20,045 --> 00:00:23,205
Leonard, it's 8 a.m.

7
00:00:23,415 --> 00:00:25,405
(Penny:)It's like the middle of the night.

8
00:00:26,685 --> 00:00:30,145
(Leonard:)I know, but I have to go to work,
and I made you breakfast.

9
00:00:30,355 --> 00:00:32,585
(Penny:)Oh, wow, that's so sweet.

10
00:00:32,791 --> 00:00:34,691
(Penny:)- Hey, what's this?
- Before you open that...

11
00:00:34,860 --> 00:00:38,590
(Leonard:)Um, are you familiar with the story
of the shoemaker and the elves?

12
00:00:38,797 --> 00:00:41,927
(Penny:)Elves? Come on, Leonard,
it's too early for Lord of the Rings.

13
00:00:42,167 --> 00:00:43,757
(Penny:)No, no.

14
00:00:46,371 --> 00:00:48,931
Listen, once upon a time,
there was this shoemaker.

15
00:00:49,174 --> 00:00:52,114
(Leonard:)And when he went to bed at night,
elves would sneak in...

16
00:00:52,310 --> 00:00:55,370
(Leonard:)...and they would make
all these amazing shoes for him.

17
00:00:55,580 --> 00:00:57,740
(Leonard:)And when the shoemaker
woke up in the morning...

18
00:00:57,916 --> 00:01:00,026
(Leonard:)...he would be super happy.

